"%i additional security update can be applied with ESM %s.\n"
"Learn more about enabling ESM %s service %s"
msgid_plural ""
"%i additional security updates can be applied with ESM %s.\n"
"Learn more about enabling ESM %s service %s"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

